---
description: |
  Builds an OCSF Network Endpoint from the remote Kunai address of a network
  event.

  Kunai resolves the hostname of a destination from the DNS responses it saw
  earlier. It also flags destinations that are public. OCSF has no such flag, so the operator maps it to the network scope: a
  public destination is external, anything else is internal to the monitored
  network.
args:
  positional:
    - name: kunai_endpoint
      type: field
      description: The Kunai address to consume.
    - name: endpoint
      type: field
      description: The field that receives the OCSF endpoint.
---

$endpoint = {
  ip: $kunai_endpoint.ip,
  port: $kunai_endpoint.port,
  hostname: $kunai_endpoint.hostname?,
  network_scope_id: 2 if $kunai_endpoint.public else 1,
}
// The IP version follows from the address.
drop $kunai_endpoint
